{{Quote|Forged from surplus hull plating, this hulking suit features an integrated servo-bracing system and a towering blast-shield collar as favored by Helldiver barbershop quartets heard throughout the galaxy.|[[Armory]] Description}}

'''BFM-220 Ironclad''' is a set of [[heavy armor]] in ''[[Helldivers 2]]''.

== Acquisition ==
Both the body armor and [[helmet]] can be claimed from the 2nd page of the [[Ironclad Democracy Premium Warbond]] for {{Currency|Medals|55|notext}} and {{Currency|Medals|45}} respectively.

== Passive Ability ==
{{Armor Passive Info Panel|Blunt-Force Mitigation}}

