== Trivia == 
* The Ironclad armor set shares its numeral designation of "'''220'''" with the [[TD-220 Bastion MK XVI|Bastion tank]], hinting that this armor may have been primarily designed for tank operators.
** In the Playstation Blog, it mentions that the armor's plates were taken from surplus hull plating, which further links the two.

